The documents in this directory were written for this repository's evaluation suite and are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

They are fictional. "Rimal Distribution" (شركة رمال للتوزيع), its customers, employees,
user ids, invoices, orders, tickets, amounts and contact addresses are made up for testing
and do not describe any real organization or person. The email domain uses the reserved
.example top-level domain.
